        "seg_cer": 0.188,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "它这个大棚里面啊，好多树通了的番茄。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 14.801,
      "end": 18.835,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "红的和火一样，看上去呢，就和开年的一个好兆头一样，",
      "score": 0.0355,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0548,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0574,
        "sc_delta": -0.0026,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.028,
        "seg_cer": 0.045,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "红雪和火一样，看上去呢，就和开年的一个好兆头一样。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 18.835,
      "end": 22.364,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这也预示到他今年的生活肯定红红火火的。",
      "score": 0.0508,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.028,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0308,
        "sc_delta": -0.0029,
